    "body": "`bip-0375/deps/dleq.py` copied dleq_* functions from `bip-0374/reference.py` and could go out of sync (#2262, #2304). Replace with a loader so the validator uses `bip-0374/reference.py`.\r\n\r\nTo run the tests:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython bip-0375/test_runner.py\r\n```",
